                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "FIPs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "280fe5b9-1757-3680-ab3f-20f31edc56a7",
                        "entry_id": "4cf615d7-185d-388a-9bd3-0681ffacc8ec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Acronym of fucking Illinois people, chiefly used by year-round inhabitants of tourist towns: a tourist (especially when wealthy) to southwestern Michigan or northwestern Indiana lakeshore towns from the Chicago area."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "acronym",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "889c85bb-ce82-42c9-903c-def1b445d9a3",
                                "sense_id": "280fe5b9-1757-3680-ab3f-20f31edc56a7",
                                "text": "Some local teens have taken to calling the weekend tourists FIPs--short for \"Fucking Illinois People.\" One can even buy a FIP T-shirt in, of all places, a New Buffalo clothing store owned by radio comedian Steve Dahl."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f8c9f5cb-24e9-4637-8505-55310358d10b",
                                "sense_id": "280fe5b9-1757-3680-ab3f-20f31edc56a7",
                                "text": "\"They're FIPs,\" he said. \"They hold their noses up in the air.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c9ef1525-e300-39c6-99ac-b9bdbeb3af9d",
                        "entry_id": "4cf615d7-185d-388a-9bd3-0681ffacc8ec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Acronym of feline infectious peritonitis."
                        ],
